    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##AI in Content Creation\r\n\r\nYou are the Pilot (the Star of the Show). The AI is your Co-Pilot (your Creative Producer). You provide the personality; the AI helps with the patterns of what makes a video click.\r\n\r\n####How to start:\r\n\r\n* Give the Co-Pilot Your Data: Don't just ask for video ideas. Be specific from your brainstorming artifacts so the AI knows your vibe.\r\n\r\n\t* _Example: \"I'm starting a gaming channel for 5th graders. My personality is 'Funny and Sarcastic.' Based on this, give me 5 video titles and a 30-second intro script.\"_\r\n\r\n* Analyze the Script: Read the script the AI wrote. Does it sound like you? Or does it sound like a robot trying to be a human? Give the AI suggestions for specific revisions.",
